WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.274 --> 00:00:01.107
- [Steven] Hey, Keith.

00:00:01.107 --> 00:00:02.357
What's up, man?

00:00:04.085 --> 00:00:05.165
Today is your lucky day.

00:00:05.165 --> 00:00:06.545
